+{
+  "category": "``s3``",
+  "description": "Deprecate the ``Expires`` member of S3 output shapes in favor of the new ``ExpiresString`` member, which holds the raw header value. If the ``Expires`` header cannot be parsed as a timestamp, the operation now completes, the ``Expires`` member is omitted, and a warning is logged instead of raising an error.",
+  "type": "enhancement"
+}
